46. AUTOMATED DEPLOYMENT
Development and test deployments may be fully automated.
Production deployment may initially require an explicit release approval.
As operational confidence increases, selected production deployments may become automatically promoted according to policy.

47. DEPLOYMENT STRATEGY
OneDraft shall support controlled deployment strategies.
Initial strategy:
rolling deployment
Future strategies may include:
blue/green
canary
feature-gated release

48. HEALTH CHECKS
Every deployable service shall expose appropriate health information.
At minimum:
liveness
readiness
version
dependency state
The deployment controller shall distinguish:
