62. REPRODUCIBLE BUILD REQUIREMENT
A release must be reproducible from:
source commit
dependency lockfiles
build configuration
container definition
migration state
The goal is that the same source state produces an equivalent release artifact.

63. BUILD ENVIRONMENT
The CI environment itself shall be controlled.
It shall define:
