69. WORKER DEPLOYMENT
Workers shall be version-compatible with the API and job schema.
A worker must not process jobs using an incompatible command or payload schema.
Job contracts shall therefore be versioned.

70. EVENT BUS DEPLOYMENT
Event schemas shall be compatible across service versions during rolling deployments.
Breaking event changes require versioned event contracts.

71. FRONTEND DEPLOYMENT
The frontend shall identify the API version it expects.
The frontend build shall verify compatibility against the published API contract.

72. MIGRATION GATE
A deployment that introduces required schema changes shall not proceed until the migration has successfully completed.
The pipeline shall verify:
expected schema version
actual schema version
application compatibility

